<div class="min-h-screen bg-[#f5f7f4] text-[#17251f]">
  <header class="border-b border-[#e4e9e4] bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 sm:px-8">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3" aria-label="Dumpsite Watch home">
        <span class="grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[#173c32] text-[#c9ef78]">
          <.icon name="hero-globe-asia-australia" class="size-6" />
        </span>
        <span>
          <span class="block text-sm font-bold tracking-tight">Dumpsite Watch</span>
          <span class="block text-xs text-[#758179]">County operations</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="hidden rounded-full border border-[#e2e8e2] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-[#65736a] sm:inline-flex">
          Prototype · data setup
        </span>
        <button type="button" disabled class="inline-flex cursor-not-allowed items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-[#173c32] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white opacity-50" title="Citizen reporting is planned">
          <.icon name="hero-plus" class="size-4" />
          <span class="hidden sm:inline">New report</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:py-10">
    <section class="mb-8 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 lg:flex-row lg:items-end">
      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#648071]">Field intelligence</p>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Cleanup priorities</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#68766e]">
          A shared view of dumpsite candidates, growth signals, and community reports. Site rankings will appear when a county and verified data are connected.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 self-start rounded-xl border border-[#e1e7e1] bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-[#718077] lg:self-auto">
        <.icon name="hero-map-pin" class="size-4 text-[#789182]" />
        <span>County not selected</span>
        <.icon name="hero-chevron-down" class="ml-2 size-4" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-label="Current monitoring summary" class="mb-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-[#718077]"><span>Sites under watch</span><.icon name="hero-eye" class="size-5" /></div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-3xl font-semibold">—</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">No verified sites loaded</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-[#718077]"><span>Reports to review</span><.icon name="hero-camera" class="size-5" /></div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-3xl font-semibold">—</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">Citizen intake not connected</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-[#718077]"><span>Area monitored</span><.icon name="hero-square-3-stack-3d" class="size-5" /></div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-3xl font-semibold">—</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">County boundary not set</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-[#718077]"><span>Data status</span><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-[#d99b47]"></span></div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-xl font-semibold">Setup in progress</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">No live sources configured</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.65fr)_minmax(340px,0.85fr)]">
      <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#edf0ed] px-5 py-4 sm:px-6">
          <div><h2 class="font-semibold">Monitoring map</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">Map layers will appear after the study area is configured</p></div>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-[#f1f4f1] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-[#718077]">No study area</span>
        </div>
        <div class="relative grid min-h-[360px] place-items-center overflow-hidden bg-[#eef2ed] sm:min-h-[470px]">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-60" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 900 520" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" class="h-full w-full">
              <path d="M-20 120C120 80 170 170 290 135s180-90 300-30 190 30 340-35M-20 205c140-40 190 50 310 15s180-90 300-30 190 30 340-35M-20 290c140-40 190 50 310 15s180-90 300-30 190 30 340-35M-20 375c140-40 190 50 310 15s180-90 300-30 190 30 340-35M-20 460c140-40 190 50 310 15s180-90 300-30 190 30 340-35" fill="none" stroke="#d7e0d6" stroke-width="2" />
              <path d="M120-20c20 110 90 150 50 260s-5 160 80 300m180-560c20 110 90 150 50 260s-5 160 80 300m180-560c20 110 90 150 50 260s-5 160 80 300" fill="none" stroke="#dce4da" stroke-width="1.5" />
              <path d="M-20 330C100 280 180 330 270 280s150-70 220-25 130 80 240 20 160-50 210-65" fill="none" stroke="#c3d9d3" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="relative mx-5 max-w-sm rounded-2xl border border-white/80 bg-white/90 p-6 text-center shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">
            <span class="mx-auto mb-4 grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#eaf1e9] text-[#41634f]"><.icon name="hero-map" class="size-6" /></span>
            <h3 class="font-semibold">Your map starts with a study area</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#718077]">Choose a county, then add validated dumpsite locations or connect the detection pipeline. This background is illustrative only.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="absolute bottom-4 left-5 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-[#89958b]">Illustrative map canvas · no geographic data</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#edf0ed] px-5 py-4 sm:px-6">
          <div><h2 class="font-semibold">Priority sites</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">Ranked with explainable risk factors</p></div>
          <button type="button" disabled class="cursor-not-allowed text-xs font-semibold text-[#8a968e]">View all</button>
        </div>
        <div class="grid min-h-[300px] place-items-center px-6 py-10 text-center">
          <div class="max-w-xs">
            <span class="mx-auto mb-4 grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#f3f5f2] text-[#7e8c82]"><.icon name="hero-clipboard-document-list" class="size-6" /></span>
            <h3 class="font-semibold">No sites to rank yet</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#7a877f]">The ranking will show site size, growth, distance to water, and nearby people once source data is available.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#edf0ed] px-5 py-4 sm:px-6">
          <p class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#87928b]">Planned scoring inputs</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="rounded-full bg-[#f2f5f1] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#647269]">Site size</span>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-[#f2f5f1] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#647269]">Growth rate</span>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-[#f2f5f1] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#647269]">Proximity to water</span>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-[#f2f5f1] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#647269]">Nearby population</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#dfe8de] bg-[#edf3eb] p-5 sm:p-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="hidden size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-white text-[#53725d] sm:grid"><.icon name="hero-sparkles" class="size-5" /></span>
          <div><h2 class="text-sm font-semibold">Next: choose the pilot county</h2><p class="mt-1 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#6f7e72]">The project plan calls for one county with known dumpsites for validation. That choice unlocks the first real map layer and keeps detection claims measurable.</p></div>
        </div>
        <span class="shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-[#d5dfd4] bg-white/70 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-[#647269]">Pilot area needed</span>
      </div>
    </section>
    <footer class="py-8 text-center text-xs text-[#98a29b]">Dumpsite Watch · Early warning for cleaner communities</footer>
  </main>
</div>
